---
// One panel per question type, each with an answer line in the CLI's format
// and colors. The answers illustrate the format; they are not from a run.
---

<div class="types not-content">
	<div class="type">
		<div class="tname">Yes or no<code>noul</code></div>
		<p class="q">Could this command destroy work that is hard to get back?</p>
		<div class="answer">
			<span class="g flag">!</span><span class="key">destructive</span><span class="v flag">yes</span><span class="pct flag">93%</span>
			<span class="meter flag" style="--p: 0.93"><i></i></span>
		</div>
		<div class="note"><code>git push --force origin main</code></div>
		<div class="rule">Flagged at <code>yes &gt;= 80%</code></div>
	</div>
	<div class="type">
		<div class="tname">One of several<code>choice</code></div>
		<p class="q">Which team should take this support ticket?</p>
		<div class="answer">
			<span></span><span class="key">queue</span><span class="v value">billing</span><span class="pct value">91%</span>
		</div>
		<div class="dist">
			<span>billing</span><span class="meter" style="--p: 0.91"><i></i></span><span>91%</span>
			<span>engineering</span><span class="meter" style="--p: 0.07"><i></i></span><span>7%</span>
			<span>other</span><span class="meter" style="--p: 0.02"><i></i></span><span>2%</span>
		</div>
		<div class="rule">Route it with <code>--format json</code></div>
	</div>
	<div class="type">
		<div class="tname">A point on a scale<code>score</code></div>
		<p class="q">How maintainable is this file?</p>
		<div class="answer">
			<span></span><span class="key">maintainability</span><span></span><span class="pct pass">2.0 of 4</span>
		</div>
		<div class="track pass" aria-hidden="true">━━━━━━<span class="off">──────</span></div>
		<div class="note">Understandable with some friction</div>
		<div class="rule">Flagged at <code>&lt;= 1.5</code></div>
	</div>
</div>

<style>
	.types {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		margin-top: 32px;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		border-radius: 12px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.type {
		padding: 22px 24px 24px;
		border-left: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
	}
	.type:first-child {
		border-left: 0;
	}
	.tname {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	code {
		padding: 0;
		background: none;
		font-size: 12.5px;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.tname code {
		margin-left: 6px;
		font-size: 12px;
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.q {
		min-height: 2.8em;
		margin: 10px 0 18px;
		font-size: 16px;
		line-height: 1.4;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.answer {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 14px auto 1fr auto;
		gap: 0 10px;
		align-items: baseline;
		font: 400 15px/1.3 var(--sl-font-mono);
	}
	.g,
	.v,
	.pct {
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.pct {
		text-align: right;
	}
	.key {
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	.answer .meter {
		grid-column: 2 / -1;
		margin-top: 10px;
	}
	.flag {
		color: var(--ans-flag);
	}
	.pass {
		color: var(--ans-pass);
	}
	.value {
		color: var(--ans-value);
	}
	.dist {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr 3em;
		gap: 8px 10px;
		align-items: center;
		margin-top: 12px;
		font: 400 13px/1 var(--sl-font-mono);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.dist .meter {
		color: var(--ans-value);
	}
	.dist span:nth-child(3n) {
		text-align: right;
	}
	.track {
		margin-top: 12px;
		font: 400 22px/1 var(--sl-font-mono);
	}
	.track .off {
		color: var(--track);
	}
	.note {
		margin-top: 8px;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	.rule {
		margin-top: 16px;
		padding-top: 12px;
		border-top: 1px dashed var(--sl-color-hairline);
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
	}
	@media (max-width: 799px) {
		.types {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
		}
		.type {
			border-left: 0;
			border-top: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
		}
		.type:first-child {
			border-top: 0;
		}
		.q {
			min-height: 0;
		}
	}
</style>
